/-!
# Genuine native analytic bundle isomorphisms and unit-sheaf Čech gauges

Actual native isomorphisms yield actual holomorphic unit gauges on the
intersection cover of the original charts. Conversely, an actual Čech
coboundary on any common covering refinement constructs an actual analytic
isomorphism of the original native bundles. Thus original native analytic
isomorphism is exactly equality of the refined Čech classes.

The native cocycle of the genuine bundle glued from an arbitrary unit-sheaf
cocycle is the actual refinement of that original cocycle, which supplies
the geometric gluing comparison needed by the separate H¹ construction.
-/
